# Trading System Agentic OS — environment contract (EXAMPLE)
# Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and override ONLY what your machine needs.
# Every var is OPTIONAL: if unset, config/paths.py uses a safe default equal to the
# current absolute path, so behavior is byte-identical to today. Portability = override these.
#
# ── Path roots (Fase 2 portability layer) ─────────────────────────────────────
# Repo root (parent of config/). Default: auto-detected from config/paths.py location.
# TRADING_SYSTEM_ROOT=/Users/cristrein/tradingview-mcp
# Data root. Default: = TRADING_SYSTEM_ROOT
# DATA_ROOT=
# RAW replay/source data (external HD). Default: /Volumes/GUTS_ LACIE/TradingData
# RAW_DATA_ROOT=/Volumes/GUTS_ LACIE/TradingData
# Reports/outputs. Default: <repo>/reports
# OUTPUT_ROOT=
# Private research/strategies (not for commercialization). Default: <repo>/my-strategy
# PRIVATE_ROOT=
# External Factors v2 module. Default: <repo>/external_factors_v2
# EXTERNAL_FACTOR_ROOT=
# Logs. Default: <repo>/alert-bridge/logs
# LOG_ROOT=
# Scratch / reproducible bootstrap tmp (e.g. causal_segments_v10.json). Default: /tmp
# TEMP_ROOT=/tmp
#
# ── Secrets (NEVER commit real values; keep in .env only) ─────────────────────
# EF v2 collector keys live in external_factors_v2/.env (see that module).
# Supabase — memory store (S1 draft; never validation, RAW stays source of truth).
# Real values ONLY in .env (gitignored). service_role NEVER in repo/client/commits.
# SUPABASE_URL=
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
# SUPABASE_DB_URL=
# SUPABASE_ENV=local        # local|dev|prod
